#### Using custom input for programming questions
* This section helps you test your code before submitting it.
* If your code has any compilation errors, you can fix them here.
* You can also test your code with custom input(s) by providing them in Custom Input test field.

#### Using custom input for SQL questions
* This section helps you test your SQL queries before submitting them.
* You can click on "Run Code" and it gives the results of your query. 
* You can also provide your own queries in the Custom Input test field and see the results of that query.
* For example if the question is to remove all the rows from the table, then you can write a query to read data from table to make sure that the table is empty.

> This section also gives you the code execution time, which helps you to understand how efficient your code is.

