   - **Chrome**: Type \`chrome://extensions\` in the address bar
   - **Edge**: Type \`edge://extensions\` in the address bar
   - **Chromium Browser**: Type \`chrome://extensions\` in the address bar

2. **Disable Extensions**: Click on each extension link below to open it directly, then disable all extensions except "ByteXL Exam Monitor".

3. **Refresh Page**: Return to this page and refresh to continue with the assessment.
